            "heading": "The details",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>This isn’t your average hairbrush.</strong> We reimagined the haircare staple to be functional, reliable, and timeless. The Detangling Brush painlessly detangles hair while preventing breakage, static, and frizz.</p><p>Use it on wet or dry hair — a hidden <strong>drainage hole</strong> prevents water retention and damage, so it never gets gross. Gentle metal bristles exfoliate the scalp to lift buildup, boost shine, and support healthy hair growth.</p><p><em>Safe to use on all hair types and extensions.</em></p>"
          }
        },
