            "content": "<p>Free standard shipping on US orders over $50. Orders ship within 24 hours, Monday–Friday.</p><p>Not in love? Return or exchange within 30 days for a full refund — we’ll even cover the return label. <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact us</a> and we’ll take care of you.</p>"
