            "heading_font_class_column_1": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "heading_tag_column_1": "h3",
            "text_column_1": "<p><strong>This isn’t your average hairbrush.</strong> We rethought every part of the haircare staple to be functional, reliable, and timeless — a tool you’ll actually love reaching for.</p><ul><li><strong>Painless detangling</strong> on wet or dry hair, with less breakage, static, and frizz.</li><li><strong>Drainage hole</strong> that prevents water retention so it never gets gross.</li><li><strong>Metal bristles</strong> that exfoliate the scalp, lift buildup, and add shine.</li><li><strong>Universally kind</strong> — safe for all hair types and extensions.</li></ul>",
