            "heading_column_1": "Metal bristles",
            "heading_font_class_column_1": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "heading_tag_column_1": "h3",
            "text_column_1": "<p>Rounded metal bristles gently exfoliate the scalp to remove buildup and stimulate circulation — which helps distribute natural oils, boost shine, and support healthy hair growth over time.</p>",
            "page_for_content_column_1": "",
            "custom_liquid_column_1": "",
            "text_font_class_column_1": "fs-body-100",
            "image_width_column_1": 100,
            "image_position_column_1": "above_text",
            "heading_column_2": "The drainage hole",
            "heading_font_class_column_2": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "heading_tag_column_2": "h3",
            "text_column_2": "<p>A purpose-built drainage hole lets water pass straight through the handle. No trapped moisture means no mildew, no damage, and a brush that dries in minutes — shower-safe by design.</p>",
            "page_for_content_column_2": "",
            "custom_liquid_column_2": "",
            "text_font_class_column_2": "fs-body-100",
            "image_width_column_2": 100,
            "image_position_column_2": "above_text"
          }
        },
        "care": {
          "type": "one_column",
          "settings": {
            "tab_heading": "Care & materials",
            "heading_column_1": "Built to last",
            "heading_font_class_column_1": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "heading_tag_column_1": "h3",
            "text_column_1": "<p>Rinse under warm water after use — the drainage hole helps it dry quickly. Wipe the handle clean and store upright. With simple care, your Detangling Brush is built to stay with you for years.</p><p><strong>Materials:</strong> durable molded handle with rounded stainless-steel bristles. Cruelty-free. Safe for all hair types and extensions.</p>",
            "page_for_content_column_1": "",
            "custom_liquid_column_1": "",
            "text_font_class_column_1": "fs-body-100",
            "content_width": "custom",
