            "heading_tag_column_1": "h3",
            "text_column_1": "<p><strong>Can I use it on wet hair?</strong><br>Yes — wet or dry. The drainage hole makes it perfect for the shower.</p><p><strong>Will it work on my hair type?</strong><br>Absolutely. It’s designed for all hair types and textures, plus extensions.</p><p><strong>Is it gentle on the scalp?</strong><br>Very. The rounded metal bristles exfoliate gently without scratching.</p><p><strong>Will it cause breakage?</strong><br>The opposite — the flexible bristles glide through knots to help prevent breakage, static, and frizz.</p><p><strong>How do I clean it?</strong><br>Rinse under water and let it air-dry. The drainage hole keeps it fresh.</p>",
